{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustrated in ballpoint pen by the artist <i>Yatara</i>, the world of Hino comes to life as a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a shadow-drenched realm overrun by eerie monsters,<br>the red-ribboned <strong>Hino</strong> and the quirky white <strong>Monimoni Skeleton</strong><br>set out on a journey in search of a safe haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is in your hands to guide them to that place of peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through lands crawling with monsters and traps,<br>you will uncover a single <i>truth</i> behind the creation of this dark world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When that truth is revealed,<br>your choices will decide which of the many endings their journey will reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D Action-Adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original story created exclusively for the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flee from, and sometimes confront, monsters born from fear itself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the truth of the world</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946090?t=1755841703","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946090?t=1755841703","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946090/3974d112f37802b85a5a8debaf275ac072976a85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755841703","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946090/3974d112f37802b85a5a8debaf275ac072976a85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755841703","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descrip